// 04 - stress test: 20x50 fully gridded array, 1000 nodes, 1051 loops.
// Converges, but takes ~11000 iterations - see the performance note in README.
// auto-generated 20x50 grid : 1000 nodes, full gridded array

UNITS     LENGTH M
UNITS     ELEVATION M
UNITS     SIZE MM
UNITS     PRESSURE KPA
UNITS     FLOW LPM
UNITS     KFACTOR LPM/KPA
METHOD    HW
OPTION    TOL_FLOW 0.05
OPTION    TOL_LOOP 0.02
OPTION    MAXITER 20000

WATER     N0_0 4.0 1200
NODE      N0_1 4.0
NODE      N0_2 4.0
